==Trivia==
*HI-DO's Normal and Evolved Form descriptions originally began with "Recruited from Metal Slug Defense!". They were changed in [[Version 13.1 Update|Ver. 13.1]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 13.7 Update|Ver. 13.7]] for all other versions to reflect the fact that ''Metal Slug Defense'' was no longer the specific game in the series that was being collaborated with.
*HI-DO's attack does not have multi hit, despite firing 6 missiles each with their own explosion, its only real hit is right as the first missile explodes.

